+## Validation transcripts (exit codes real)
+
+Shell: `bash`, repo root, `CURATOR_CONFORMANCE_ROOT=…/curator-spec/conformance/v1`
+unless noted. Shared host: sibling agents' suites ran concurrently;
+see the contention note.
